  "scope": "Actual ramified integer-order scaling and its native degree-one residue consequence. Four independent universes. Not all-degree ramified residue naturality or arbitrary-uniformizer canonical comparison.",
  "hypotheses": "DVRs R:Type u,S:Type v with fraction fields F:Type w,E:Type z; j:R\u2192+*S, f:F\u2192+*E and commuting algebraMap square hf; pi:R and rho:S irreducible; u:S\u02e3,e:Nat with exact equality j pi=(u:S)*rho^e. No IsLocalHom or positivity assumption is required, matching source ramified_value_map. For a local j the supplied equation forces 0<e, checked explicitly in tests.",
