  "upstream_audit": "No ramified fraction-unit order scaling or typed ramified K1 residue field-map endpoint found in pinned DvrTameSymbol. Existing native fraction decomposition, dvrFracOrd_eq_of_eq, uniformizer units and K0/K1 equivalences are directly reused. Existing degree-one transport naturality is same-universe only; new result is compatible through established RingTransport comparisons.",
